# Recorded input for the progress bar example (widgets/progress.zig, `Example`), at 320 x 240 in
# the default theme: the download bar's track at y 41.5..49.5 across x 16..304. The pointer
# presses, drags over and releases on it; nothing changes.
# 0: rest
frame
viewport 320 240
dt 0.016
pointer 300 225
# 1: over the download bar
frame
pointer 100 45
# 2: press on it
frame
buttons left
# 3: drag along it
frame
pointer 250 45
# 4: release
frame
buttons
